*.tar.shards

# Tmux pane dump logs
[0-9]*_bash_*.log

# Local benchmark artifacts (large; not part of the repo)
/tmp/
untracked

# Stray shell redirect at the repo root (`... > out`). Harmless in itself, but
# an untracked file makes `git status --porcelain` non-empty, and
# docker/opengroundingdino/_build_provenance.sh keys the image's kit_sha label
# off exactly that -- so it silently stamps every build "<sha>-dirty" and the
# image stops being reproducible from git. Root-anchored so a legitimate `out/`
# directory deeper in the tree is unaffected.
/out
